.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-snooze 1  "snooze " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-snooze \- Remind about a task again later: one hour from now by default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit snooze\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIR\fR> [\fIPHRASE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remind about a task again later: one hour from now by default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIR\fR>
A row number, id prefix or title words
.TP
[\fIPHRASE\fR]
When to remind: a phrase with a time, else 09:00 on that day. Default: one hour from now
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit snooze 1
  orbit snooze 3f2b9c "tomorrow 9am"
  orbit snooze 1 "in 2 hours" \-\-dry\-run
